ype': ['Method', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, 'Transformer distillation method': {'description': ['A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A novel method specifically designed for knowledge distillation of Transformer-based models, enabling the transfer of knowledge from a large teacher BERT to a smaller student TinyBERT.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'The novel approach used to transfer knowledge from BERT layers to TinyBERT.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'The novel method used to transfer knowledge from BERT layers to TinyBERT.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'The novel approach used to transfer knowledge from BERT layers to TinyBERT.'], 'type': ['Method', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, 'General Distillation (GD)': {'description': ['A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A pre-training stage in the two-stage learning framework, using a large corpus to initialize TinyBERT.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A pre-training stage in the two-stage learning framework, using a large corpus to initialize TinyBERT.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT is initialized using a large corpus.', 'A pre-training stage method where TinyBERT learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT model.'], 'type': ['Method', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, 'Data Augmentation (DA)': {'description': ['A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'The process of creating new training data from existing data, used in the task-specific distillation stage.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'The process of creating new training data from existing data, used in the task-specific distillation stage.', 'A method to accelerate inference and reduce model size while maintaining performance.', 'The process of creating new training data from existing data to improve model performance, used in the task-specific distillation stage.', 'The process of creating more task-related materials for teacher-student learning, used in the task-specific distillation stage to provide more training data.'], 'type': ['Method', 'method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, 'Transformer layer': {'description': ['A core component of the Transformer architecture, consisting of multi-head attention and feed-forward networks, used to process input sequences.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 7]}, 'Transformer Layer': {'description': ['A fundamental building block of Transformer models, consisting of sub-layers like Multi-Head Attention and Feed-Forward Networks. The paper focuses on distilling knowledge from these layers in BERT to TinyBERT.', 'The layers within the Transformer architecture from which knowledge is distilled, including Multi-Head Attention and Feed-Forward Network.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 7]}}
